		{"id":"8b52fe0b4630fe1a","type":"text","text":"| 1   | Theft - Cruta Trailer | 5/06/2024 | Located at S/W on 13/06/2024 (743 Sayers Rd)<br><br>Accused stated he bought the trailer from \"Mick Longley\" for $1000; said he did not check VIN or plate | Do we have the tracking data from the trailer? What does it say?<br><br>Who is Mick Longley? How did he pay? Receipts? |\n| --- | --------------------- | --------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |","x":-3280,"y":-2840,"width":981,"height":200,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"546d9f2110272ad0","type":"text","text":"| 2   | HRRSG - Cruta Trailer | 13/06/2024 | Located at S/W on 13/06/2024 (743 Sayers Rd) |     |\n| --- | --------------------- | ---------- | -------------------------------------------- | --- |","x":-3280,"y":-2600,"width":981,"height":80,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"980c802455ae55cd","type":"text","text":"| 3   | Burglary - 20A Fairbridge Rd - Intent to Steal | 6-7/6/2024 | Accused denied knowledge of burglary. Was surprised that keys were in the Hyundai. Denied knowing address. When asked why address was on phone; stated it might have had something to do with Marketplace and buyting a heater; stated tghat he attended address with Sammy Lamb to purcahse heater.<br><br>Denied Burglary; stated he bought the heater and left the address; Sammy must have gone back to address and done the burg. | Who is the neighbour? Can we get a statement from them?<br><br>Can we get a statement from Leo, the partner that was home at the time? Did they ever actually attend the address? The accused says they did, but we don't have statements. |\n| --- | ---------------------------------------------- | ---------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ |","x":-3280,"y":-2480,"width":1050,"height":330,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"1cb817db7018c126","type":"text","text":"| 4   | HRRSG - Various House Keys | 16/06/2024 | Located at S/W on 13/06/2024 (743 Sayers Rd); these were inside the Hyundai Veloster (re Chg 18); |     |\n| --- | -------------------------- | ---------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- | --- |","x":-3280,"y":-2120,"width":1050,"height":120,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"aabdad7a1125853c","type":"text","text":"\n| 5   | Burglary - 135 Kenning Road Tarneit - Intent to Steal | 8-9/6/2024 | Accused denied knowledge of burglary; agreed that items were at his property during S/W. | CCTV? Offender(s)? Why plural? How do we link accused to this? |\n| --- | ----------------------------------------------------- | ---------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- | -------------------------------------------------------------- |","x":-3280,"y":-1970,"width":1050,"height":96,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"a90c09058053f419","type":"text","text":"| 18  | S/W | HRRSG - Hyundai Veloster | 13/06/2024 | Located at S/W on 13/06/2024 (743 Sayers Rd). The keys located inside the Nissan Navara opened this vehicle. This was bearing the rego plates 1VK6RC (re 13 and 14).<br><br>Accused denied knowing it was stolen or carjacking incident; stated that friend \"Sam\" dropped item off couple of days prior to S/W.<br><br>Accused denied the Hyundai keys being in his ute. |     |\n| --- | --- | ------------------------ | ---------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ | --- |","x":-3280,"y":920,"width":1050,"height":280,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"682993ec8bd258f2","type":"text","text":"| 19  | 5   | Theft From Motor Vehicle - Milwauke Tools (Thomas ZIVIC) | 25/06/2024 | CCTV from Bunnings has face angel of accused; distinctive facial tattoo's which match custody photograph. |     |\n| --- | --- | -------------------------------------------------------- | ---------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- | --- |","x":-3280,"y":1240,"width":1050,"height":120,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"68c98ba57e81957a","type":"text","text":"| 6   | 4   | Theft - Jayco Caravan | 8-9/6/2024 | Located in Mount Cottrell; paperwork for this located inside the Hyundai Veloster (re Chg 18); Accuseds mobile phone contain photographs of the caravan at another location to his property; Accused claims photographs taken by \"Sammy LAMB\" as he used his phone; Phone photograph data showed Mount Cottrell location; investigators attended and located the stolen Caravan there.<br><br>Accused stated that Sammy had his phone and took the photographs; did not know anything further. | Any forensics inside the caravan to put accused there? |\n| --- | --- | --------------------- | ---------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------ |","x":-3280,"y":-1830,"width":1050,"height":310,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"c029750bdc369cd7","type":"text","text":"| 7   | 4   | Theft - Remote Control Car | 9/06/2024 | Located at S/W on 13/06/2024 (743 Sayers Rd); found in separate caravan in the read of the property.<br><br>Accused stated that he purchased the item from \"Sammy LAMB\" | Have we identified / followed up with Sammy LAMB? |\n| --- | --- | -------------------------- | --------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------- |","x":-3280,"y":-1480,"width":1050,"height":200,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"72818c483a6893ab","type":"text","text":"| 8   | 4   | HRRSG - Jayco Caravan | 13/06/2024 | See Chg 6 (located in Mt. Cottrell) |     |\n| --- | --- | --------------------- | ---------- | ----------------------------------- | --- |","x":-3280,"y":-1240,"width":1050,"height":100,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"00a9499da8982607","type":"text","text":"| 9   | 4   | HRRSG - Remote Control Car | 13/06/2024 | Located at S/W on 13/06/2024 (743 Sayers Rd); inside an unrelated caravan on the property in the backyard |     |\n| --- | --- | -------------------------- | ---------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- | --- |","x":-3280,"y":-1080,"width":1050,"height":120,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"18bcec46ee358f7f","type":"text","text":"| 10  | S/W | DPSPC - Compound Bow | 13/06/2024 | This is not a prohibited weapon (only Crossbows are; it's on the brief as a \"compound bow\"); Located at S/W on 13/06/2024 (743 Sayers Rd); believed to be stolen; | Where did he buy it from? Receipts? Etc. |\n| --- | --- | -------------------- | ---------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- | ---------------------------------------- |","x":-3280,"y":-920,"width":1050,"height":120,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"e45cc95b01f4cae5","type":"text","text":"| 11  | S/W | DPSPC - Motorola Radio Bank | 13/06/2024 | Located at S/W on 13/06/2024 (743 Sayers Rd); believed to be stolen; accused stated he uses them for traffic control work<br><br>Located inside a Holden Commodore which accused admitted was his. Purchased himself for $1200 | Receipts? Where from? Work location? Etc. |\n| --- | --- | --------------------------- | ---------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ | ----------------------------------------- |","x":-3280,"y":-760,"width":1050,"height":200,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"bc9f5f7aaf483df9","type":"text","text":"| 12  | 1   | Theft From Motor Vehicle - Rego Plates 1VK6RC | 23-24/5/2024 | Located at S/W on 13/06/2024 (743 Sayers Rd); attached to the Hyundai Veloster (chg 18)<br><br>Accused stated he checked the registration and it came up as \"Cancelled or something\" |     |\n| --- | --- | --------------------------------------------- | ------------ | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ | --- |","x":-3280,"y":-520,"width":1050,"height":160,"color":"1"},
