		{"id":"ca513035b7c56c9c","type":"text","text":"| 16  | 4   | HRRSG - Rego Plates 76711A | 13/06/2024 | Located at S/W on 13/06/2024 (743 Sayers Rd); inside the stolen Nissan Navara<br><br>Accused denied knowledge of the plates inside the ute. |     |\n| --- | --- | -------------------------- | ---------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- | --- |","x":-3280,"y":240,"width":1050,"height":160,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"3be83066617ce27a","type":"text","text":"| 17  | S/W | HRRSG - Nissan Navara 1WT7IJ | 13/06/2024 | Located at S/W on 13/06/2024 (743 Sayers Rd). The Nissan Navara was believed to be a stolen vehicle when found by police. The accused stated he got this vehicle from \"Jason\" in Churchill during ROI; accused stated he had been working on vehicle and replaced parts on it; believed it was a write off or unregistered; stated communication between Jason and him was on old phone and no longer available; forensic examination provided that the vehicle was an outstanding stolen vehicle.<br><br>Accused stated that he leant this ute to Sammy LAMB and he was using it | Where were the keys for this ute found? How did he have the keys if Sammy LAMB was using it?<br><br>Who is Jason? When did he buy it? Etc. Can he get the old records off his old phone? |\n| --- | --- | ---------------------------- | ---------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |","x":-3280,"y":440,"width":1050,"height":440,"color":"4"},
